Subject: [PATCH 06/17] Fix issue where webpack looks for file extension in esm
 projects

---
 packages/react-sdk/rollup.config.js     | 55 +++++++++++++------------
 packages/react-sdk/src/BubbleChat.tsx   |  2 +-
 packages/react-sdk/src/FullPageChat.tsx |  2 +-
